        "im:version": {
          "label": "1.7.346"
        },
        "id": {
          "label": "14667156847"
        },
        "title": {
          "label": "Unintuitive bloat"
        },
        "content": {
          "label": "One of the most unintuitive apps I’ve ever used. Even the AI assistant built-in can’t answer simple questions. \n\nI literally just want to create a kanban style board to track projects in 4 stages but there is no ability to add a 4th step in the board. It just defaults to the “not started”, “in progress”, and “done” steps. \n\nApparently online I’ve read that there is something called statuses and I need to update my database… what database? I have created nothing. This app is god awful and incredibly hostile to users. \n\nTry making a less convoluted app.",
          "attributes": {
            "type": "text"
          }
        },
        "link": {
          "attributes": {
            "rel": "related",
            "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1232780281&type=Purple%20Software"
          }
        },
        "im:voteSum": {
          "label": "0"
        },
