        "im:version": {
          "label": "1.7.346"
        },
        "id": {
          "label": "14663973234"
        },
        "title": {
          "label": "Lacking in Functionality"
        },
        "content": {
          "label": "I enjoy the/Laptop app, but on phones and ipads it just feels clunky and lacks a lot of the quick functionality features that make it a good tool. For me, especially with ADHD, it starts to feel less like an organization and note taking app, and more like an extra task in it of itself. \n\nI think these would make a huge difference :\n\n— bulk photo delete \n— bulk tab moving \n— command buttons (could use the 3 lines at the bottom.)\n— more intuitive ways to organize (charts, calendars, etc are quite difficult to use in app.)",
          "attributes": {
            "type": "text"
          }
        },
        "link": {
          "attributes": {
            "rel": "related",
            "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1232780281&type=Purple%20Software"
          }
        },
